  "title": {
    "rendered": "Data Processing &amp; Protection"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"596\" class=\"elementor elementor-596\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2445098 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2445098\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eb79cfe elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"eb79cfe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-26d35dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"26d35dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Data Processing &amp; Protection</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5d5bf72 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5d5bf72\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Overview</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57b7de5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"57b7de5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"25\">This Data Processing &amp; Protection statement explains how LMH, operating as <span data-inline-card=\"true\" data-card-url=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com\"><span class=\"loader-wrapper\"><a class=\"_1yt4x7n9 _2rko12b0 _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz1y58 _1rkwglyw _4cvxmr28 _19it1x13 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b1r31 _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehicw00 _1j5pglyw _1di629zg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" href=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com/\" data-testid=\"inline-card-resolved-view\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66\" data-testid=\"inline-card-icon-and-title\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw\">Home</span></span></a></span></span> , processes and protects personal data in connection with <span data-inline-card=\"true\" data-card-url=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com\"><span class=\"loader-wrapper\"><a class=\"_1yt4x7n9 _2rko12b0 _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz1y58 _1rkwglyw _4cvxmr28 _19it1x13 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b1r31 _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehicw00 _1j5pglyw _1di629zg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" href=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com/\" data-testid=\"inline-card-resolved-view\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66\" data-testid=\"inline-card-icon-and-title\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw\">Home</span></span></a></span></span> and our coaching, speaking, and online course Services. It supplements our Privacy Policy.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f666dbf elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f666dbf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Roles and Responsibilities</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62746d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"62746d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"639\">We generally act as a &#8220;data controller&#8221; when we determine the purposes and means of processing personal data (for example, for Website visitors, email subscribers, and clients). In certain limited situations, such as specific client engagements, we may act as a &#8220;data processor,&#8221; handling personal data on a client&#8217;s instructions under a separate Data Processing Agreement, where required by law.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-041e252 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"041e252\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Categories of Data Processed</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4eb4fa5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4eb4fa5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We may process the following categories of personal data:<br />• Contact data (name, email address, phone number)<br />• Account and booking data (for courses, programs, and coaching)<br />• Payment-related data (billing information, processed via third-party providers)<br />• Marketing data (email engagement, preferences, unsubscribes)<br />• Technical data (IP address, device and browser information, cookies)<br />• Communication data (messages, feedback, testimonials)</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c21302 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5c21302\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Purposes of Processing</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44d7a6a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"44d7a6a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We process personal data to:<br />• Provide and manage our coaching, speaking, and online course Services<br />• Operate, maintain, and secure our Website and systems<br />• Communicate with you, including providing support and responding to inquiries<br />• Send transactional and, where permitted, marketing communications<br />• Comply with legal, tax, and accounting obligations<br />• Analyze performance and improve our offerings</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b1613b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b1613b5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Processors and Third-Party Services</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce4dc67 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ce4dc67\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We use third-party service providers (processors) to support our operations, which may include:<br />• Website hosting and infrastructure<br />• Email marketing and automation platforms<br />• Payment processors<br />• Analytics and performance monitoring tools<br />• Cloud storage and collaboration platforms</p><p>These providers process personal data only on our instructions and are expected to implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect personal data.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e795ac elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1e795ac\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Security Measures</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a117cce elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a117cce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"2100\">We take reasonable steps to protect personal data against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction. Measures may include:<br />• Secure connections (HTTPS) for data transmission where available<br />• Access controls and authentication for systems<br />• Use of reputable third-party providers with security practices<br />• Regular updates and maintenance of systems</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"2488\">No system can be completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-539ebfd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"539ebfd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">International Data Transfers</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-541c094 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"541c094\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3385\">Because we are based in the United States and may use service providers located in multiple countries, personal data may be transferred outside your jurisdiction. When required by law (for example, for data from the EEA or UK), we rely on appropriate safeguards such as Standard Contractual Clauses or other approved mechanisms.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8193d10 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8193d10\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Data Retention</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f597c64 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f597c64\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We retain personal data only as long as necessary for the purposes described in this statement and our Privacy Policy or as required by law. For example:<br />Contact form submissions may be retained for approximately 12–24 months<br />Email marketing data is retained until you unsubscribe or we remove inactive subscribers<br />Client and transaction records may be kept for periods required by tax and accounting laws</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-908299c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"908299c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Data Subject Rights</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b15237a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b15237a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3361\">Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have rights such as:<br />• Access to your personal data<br />• Correction of inaccurate or incomplete data<br />• Deletion of your personal data, subject to legal obligations<br />• Restriction or objection to certain processing activities<br />• Data portability (in certain circumstances)<br />• Withdrawal of consent, where processing is based on consent</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3768\">To exercise these rights, contact us at <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" href=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com</a>. If we act as a processor for a client, we may need to forward your request to that client (the controller) and follow their instructions.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a238bf0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a238bf0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Contact</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bee1015 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bee1015\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3385\">For questions about this Data Processing &amp; Protection statement or our data practices, please contact:<br />• Email: <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" href=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com</a><br />• Alternate email: <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" href=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com</a></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3eaee01 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"3eaee01\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
